WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.097
Puss bowed. "Greetings, Your Majesty."

2
00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:11.339
The king gasped. "You talk!"

3
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.485
Servants began to whisper.

4
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:20.375
Puss shrugged. "It's no big deal."

5
00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:23.151
The king looked at Puss' boots.

6
00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:29.399
"Excellent boots," he said. "Very fancy!"

7
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.023
"Thank you," Puss said.

8
00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:34.697
"It's important to look neat."

9
00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:41.229
The king grinned. "I feel the same way!"

10
00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:44.754
He walked over to Puss.

11
00:00:44.755 --> 00:00:46.719
"You're a fine fellow.

12
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.892
How can I help you?"

13
00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:54.623
"I have a gift for you," Puss said.

14
00:00:54.624 --> 00:00:57.399
He pulled the rabbit from the bag.

15
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.553
"It's from my master, the Duke of Carabas."

16
00:01:01.554 --> 00:01:04.513
"Wonderful!" the king said.

17
00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:11.272
"Tell the duke I said thank you."

18
00:01:11.273 --> 00:01:16.617
The next day Puss went to the forest.

19
00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:21.747
He placed seeds in the bag.

20
00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:27.435
Puss climbed up a tree and waited.

21
00:01:27.436 --> 00:01:33.103
Two birds landed near the bag.

22
00:01:33.104 --> 00:01:36.669
They pecked at the seeds.

23
00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:40.768
Puss leaped from a branch.

24
00:01:40.769 --> 00:01:47.570
He pounced on the birds and caught them!

25
00:01:47.571 --> 00:01:53.556
Puss returned to the castle with the birds.

26
00:01:53.557 --> 00:02:00.205
He bowed. "A gift from the Duke of Carabas."

27
00:02:00.206 --> 00:02:04.229
"Lovely!" the king said.

28
00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:09.320
The king handed a gold coin to Puss.

29
00:02:09.321 --> 00:02:13.989
"Please give this to the duke."

30
00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.269
"Thank you," Puss said.

31
00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:20.598
"But the duke has everything he needs."

32
00:02:20.599 --> 00:02:22.940
The king smiled warmly.

33
00:02:22.941 --> 00:02:26.848
"Then he can buy something he doesn't need.

34
00:02:26.849 --> 00:02:33.540
You must take it!"

